      "writtenOn": "2023-01-27T22:25:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Great. Thanks everyone. Follow-up CLs will populate the allowed UIDs on the network capabilities for default networks as per our recent design discussions so that `nc.isUidWithAccess(uid)` will take default networks into account.\n\nI\u0027ve also changed the ordering to do the less expensive checks first as suggested.",
      "parentUuid": "7e4421b1_d6d1a266",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 5995,
        "startChar": 31,
        "endLine": 5995,
