      "message": "Since this gets called for onAvailable, if this approach is taken (which seems to be correct since onBlocked gets called for other criteria here), unit tests in ConnectivityService (19 currently) and most likely ConnectivityManager CTS tests will need to be updated in cases where restricted networks are created depending on what onAvailable... helper method is used to validate against.\n\nThe changes themselves should be fairly small (simple IF statement for SDK level using the existing helper or a different helper) but something to be aware of.",
