      "message": "It seems we might want to targeting U.\nBut I\u0027m not sure this is needed.\nWould our solution compatible with current Apps?\nIt seems to me the only change is that we\u0027ll have onBlockedStatusChange for restricted network change, which we didn\u0027t have before.\nIf so, maybe we don\u0027t need to check SDK level?",
