      "writtenOn": "2023-01-05T08:27:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In principle it must be U : it\u0027s not allowed to return a constant that wasn\u0027t in the SDK that the app is targetting. Also, it will actually change the semantics of the code, so it\u0027s better to not do that to apps that do not upgrade their SDK.\n\nIf Auto manufacturers need this to be backported to S/T, then we may want to enrich this a little bit and carve out some exceptions, but we would need to discuss what they should be.",
      "parentUuid": "4e8e1586_1a1a92cf",
