      "writtenOn": "2022-12-20T22:43:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m curious what the thoughts are on this. Specifically, for the per-app default functionality (5G slicing, PANS), they would also populate the allowedUids field on the network capabilities object. If that works, then the existing callbacks should also work.\n\nAlternatively, the new helper method isUidPerAppRestricted could be updated to account for per-app defaults.\n\nEither of the above (or something else?) should work, curious what thoughts are on either approach?",
      "range": {
